usage: prthinker [-h] [--config CONFIG]
                 [--log-level {DEBUG,INFO,WARNING,ERROR}]
                 [--otel-endpoint OTEL_ENDPOINT]
                 {review-pr,pr-summary,review-file,aggregate,post-status,harvest-dismissed,harvest-accepted,stats,review-commits,report,mcp,adversarial-eval,build-kg,visualize-kg,discover-rules,derive-lessons,hook,triage,benchmark,depth-eval,verify,retrieval-eval,retrieval-report,attest,issue-fix,issue-autofix,adversarial-benchmark,quality,ablation-study,ide,release-check}
                 ...

positional arguments:
  {review-pr,pr-summary,review-file,aggregate,post-status,harvest-dismissed,harvest-accepted,stats,review-commits,report,mcp,adversarial-eval,build-kg,visualize-kg,discover-rules,derive-lessons,hook,triage,benchmark,depth-eval,verify,retrieval-eval,retrieval-report,attest,issue-fix,issue-autofix,adversarial-benchmark,quality,ablation-study,ide,release-check}
    pr-summary          Generate a Copilot-style PR summary from the PR title,
                        description, commit messages, and diff, then upsert it
                        as a dedicated PR comment. Designed to run before the
                        per-file review starts (e.g. the enumerate job).
    aggregate           Merge partial review JSONs (from `review-pr --output-
                        json` runners in a matrix) and post a single summary +
                        inline review + gate close to the PR.
    post-status         Upsert a 'review in progress' placeholder comment so
                        reviewers see the review has started before the full
                        result is posted.
    harvest-dismissed   Scan PR/MR review comments for dismissed findings;
                        append to JSONL
    harvest-accepted    Scan PRs/MRs for applied suggestions; append to JSONL
    stats               Aggregate telemetry: tokens, cost, latency, cache hit
                        rate
    review-commits      Review commit-message quality (messages read from
                        stdin, one per line)
    report              Cross-store longitudinal report — telemetry + cache +
                        dismissed + accepted. Renders to markdown / HTML /
                        JSON.
    mcp                 Run the Model Context Protocol stdio server (for
                        Claude Desktop / Cursor / Continue / Cline / Zed
                        integration). Reads PRTHINKER_* env vars for backend
                        config.
    adversarial-eval    Run a corpus of attack diffs through the configured
                        backend and record per-case bypass outcomes into
                        SQLite. Does NOT emit aggregate detection-rate numbers
                        — compute those from the raw output table.
    build-kg            Walk the repo and persist a {symbol: file:line} table
                        to SQLite. Run once per repo (or when symbol surface
                        drifts) before using --kg-ground on review-pr /
                        review-file.
    visualize-kg        Render the per-repo knowledge graph as a self-
                        contained D3 force-directed HTML page. Opens in any
                        browser; no server. Run `build-kg` first if the store
                        is empty.
    discover-rules      Cluster persisted finding fingerprints across PRs and
                        print the families that recur ≥ N times. Use to
                        identify candidate rules for --rules-dir.
    derive-lessons      Batch recent dismissed + accepted examples and ask the
                        model to distil general review rules; append to
                        lessons.jsonl. Run weekly via cron or GHA schedule.
    hook                Read `git diff --cached`, run the pipeline, exit non-
                        zero on error-severity findings. Intended as a pre-
                        commit hook.
    triage              Run all no-model orientation signals over a diff (no
                        backend, no GPU). Reads stdin by default; or --diff-
                        file / --staged / --against REF.
    benchmark           Convert, score, and compare review benchmarks
    depth-eval          Run a diff corpus at full and adaptive review depth
                        and report the finding-quality delta next to the
                        model-call and token savings.
    verify              Run evidence-producing verification tools
    retrieval-eval      Score retrieval JSONL records
    retrieval-report    Summarize content-safe retrieval trajectory JSONL
    attest              Emit review/SLSA attestations and AI BOM
    issue-fix           Localise and propose validated edits that resolve an
                        issue
    issue-autofix       Fetch tracker issues, propose validated fixes, open
                        fix PRs
    ide                 Versioned JSONL review protocol over stdin/stdout

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       Path to a .prthinker.yaml (default: ./.prthinker.yaml
                        if present)
  --log-level {DEBUG,INFO,WARNING,ERROR}
  --otel-endpoint OTEL_ENDPOINT
                        OTLP/HTTP traces endpoint (requires observability
                        extra)
